// Dialog :
"P846691517" "Thank you! This sample will help our research immensely.<br><br>Since you are new to Paragon City, you should familiarize yourself with the way hospitals work here. There is an Information Terminal in front of Rivera Medical Center next to me you need to read.<br><br><img src=COH_InfoTerminal.tga><br><br><color lightblue>Move next to this terminal and click on it to read the information it has</color>, you can then return to Officer Flint for more instructions."

